{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-processing-architecture","title":"流处理架构与实时计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/stream-and-batch-processing/stream-processing-architecture","wordCount":1281,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流处理架构与实时计算\">流处理架构与实时计算</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>流处理（Stream Processing）是处理无界、持续到达的数据流的计算范式。与批处理的&quot;存储后处理&quot;不同，流处理在数据到达的瞬间进行计算，实现毫秒到秒级的处理延迟。在 2026 年，随着 AI 实时推理、实时风控和事件驱动架构的普及，流处理已从&quot;可选优化&quot;变为&quot;基础设施必备&quot;。</p>\n<p>本文深入分析现代流处理框架的核心架构，包括事件时间语义、状态管理、容错机制和架构选型，帮助工程师构建生产级实时数据管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"流处理的核心挑战\">流处理的核心挑战</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无界数据</td>\n<td>流没有终点，何时触发计算？</td>\n<td>窗口（Window）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乱序事件</td>\n<td>事件到达顺序 ≠ 发生顺序</td>\n<td>Watermark</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>增量计算需要维护中间状态</td>\n<td>有状态算子 + State Backend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错</td>\n<td>节点故障后如何恢复状态？</td>\n<td>Checkpoint + Savepoint</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exactly-Once</td>\n<td>如何保证每条消息恰好处理一次？</td>\n<td>分布式快照 + 两阶段提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td>上游速度 &gt; 下游处理能力</td>\n<td>动态背压传播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"事件时间-vs-处理时间\">事件时间 vs 处理时间</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"事件时间 (Event Time):  事件实际发生的时间 (嵌入事件中)&#10;处理时间 (Processing Time): 事件被系统处理的时间 (系统时钟)&#10;摄入时间 (Ingestion Time): 事件进入系统的时间&#10;&#10;示例:&#10;  用户 10:00:00 点击按钮 (Event Time)&#10;  消息 10:00:03 到达 Kafka (Ingestion Time)&#10;  Flink 10:00:05 处理该消息 (Processing Time)&#10;&#10;为什么事件时间重要:&#10;  - 网络延迟导致事件乱序到达&#10;  - 设备离线后批量上传&#10;  - 跨时区用户行为需要统一时间线\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>事件时间 (Event Time):  事件实际发生的时间 (嵌入事件中)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>处理时间 (Processing Time): 事件被系统处理的时间 (系统时钟)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>摄入时间 (Ingestion Time): 事件进入系统的时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  用户 10:00:00 点击按钮 (Event Time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  消息 10:00:03 到达 Kafka (Ingestion Time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Flink 10:00:05 处理该消息 (Processing Time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>为什么事件时间重要:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 网络延迟导致事件乱序到达</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 设备离线后批量上传</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 跨时区用户行为需要统一时间线</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"watermark-机制\">Watermark 机制</h3><p>Watermark 是流处理系统用来追踪事件时间进度的机制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Event: t=10:01&quot;] --&gt; W[&quot;Watermark: t=10:00&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; B[&quot;Event: t=10:02&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Event: t=9:58 - LATE!&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Watermark: t=10:02&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Event: t=10:01\"] --&gt; W[\"Watermark: t=10:00\"]\n    W --&gt; B[\"Event: t=10:02\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Event: t=9:58 - LATE!\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Watermark: t=10:02\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Flink Watermark 策略&#10;WatermarkStrategy&#10;    .&lt;Event&gt;forBoundedOutOfOrderness(Duration.ofSeconds(5))&#10;    .withTimestampAssigner((event, timestamp) -&gt; event.getTimestamp());&#10;&#10;// 含义: 允许最多 5 秒的乱序&#10;// Watermark = 已观察到的最大事件时间 - 5秒&#10;// 当 Watermark 超过窗口结束时间时触发窗口计算\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Flink Watermark 策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">WatermarkStrategy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forBoundedOutOfOrderness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withTimestampAssigner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((event, timestamp) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTimestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 含义: 允许最多 5 秒的乱序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Watermark = 已观察到的最大事件时间 - 5秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 当 Watermark 超过窗口结束时间时触发窗口计算</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>处理迟到数据的策略：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>Flink API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n<td>忽略迟到数据</td>\n<td>默认行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>允许延迟</td>\n<td>窗口延迟关闭</td>\n<td><code>.allowedLateness(Duration.ofMinutes(1))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侧输出</td>\n<td>迟到数据路由到旁路</td>\n<td><code>.sideOutputLateData(lateTag)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新结果</td>\n<td>收到迟到数据后重新触发计算</td>\n<td>Accumulating/Retracting 模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"窗口类型\">窗口类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>窗口类型</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滚动窗口 (Tumbling)</td>\n<td>固定大小，不重叠</td>\n<td>每分钟 PV 统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口 (Sliding)</td>\n<td>固定大小，可重叠</td>\n<td>5 分钟滑动平均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话窗口 (Session)</td>\n<td>按活跃间隙分割</td>\n<td>用户会话分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局窗口 (Global)</td>\n<td>所有数据在一个窗口</td>\n<td>自定义触发逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Flink 窗口示例&#10;DataStream&lt;Event&gt; events = ...;&#10;&#10;// 滚动窗口: 每 5 分钟统计一次&#10;events&#10;    .keyBy(Event::getUserId)&#10;    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(5)))&#10;    .aggregate(new CountAggregator());&#10;&#10;// 会话窗口: 30 秒无活动则关闭会话&#10;events&#10;    .keyBy(Event::getUserId)&#10;    .window(EventTimeSessionWindows.withGap(Time.seconds(30)))&#10;    .process(new SessionAnalyzer());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Flink 窗口示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ...;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 滚动窗口: 每 5 分钟统计一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getUserId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TumblingEventTimeWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CountAggregator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 会话窗口: 30 秒无活动则关闭会话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getUserId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EventTimeSessionWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withGap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">seconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SessionAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"状态管理与-checkpoint\">状态管理与 Checkpoint</h3><p>Flink 的 Checkpoint 基于 Chandy-Lamport 分布式快照算法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant JM as JobManager&#10;    participant S as Source&#10;    participant O1 as Operator 1&#10;    participant O2 as Operator 2&#10;    participant Sink as Sink&#10;&#10;    JM-&gt;&gt;S: Trigger Checkpoint&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: Snapshot source offset&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;O1: Inject Barrier&#10;    O1-&gt;&gt;O1: Snapshot state&#10;    O1-&gt;&gt;O2: Forward Barrier&#10;    O2-&gt;&gt;O2: Snapshot state&#10;    O2-&gt;&gt;Sink: Forward Barrier&#10;    Sink-&gt;&gt;JM: Checkpoint Complete\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant JM as JobManager\n    participant S as Source\n    participant O1 as Operator 1\n    participant O2 as Operator 2\n    participant Sink as Sink\n\n    JM-&gt;&gt;S: Trigger Checkpoint\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: Snapshot source offset\n    S-&gt;&gt;O1: Inject Barrier\n    O1-&gt;&gt;O1: Snapshot state\n    O1-&gt;&gt;O2: Forward Barrier\n    O2-&gt;&gt;O2: Snapshot state\n    O2-&gt;&gt;Sink: Forward Barrier\n    Sink-&gt;&gt;JM: Checkpoint Complete</pre><p><strong>State Backend 选择：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Backend</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>状态大小</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HashMapStateBackend</td>\n<td>JVM 堆内存</td>\n<td>&lt; 数 GB</td>\n<td>状态小，延迟极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EmbeddedRocksDBStateBackend</td>\n<td>本地磁盘 (RocksDB)</td>\n<td>TB 级</td>\n<td>大状态，略高延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 配置 RocksDB State Backend&#10;StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();&#10;env.setStateBackend(new EmbeddedRocksDBStateBackend());&#10;env.enableCheckpointing(60000); // 每 60 秒 Checkpoint&#10;env.getCheckpointConfig().setCheckpointingMode(CheckpointingMode.EXACTLY_ONCE);&#10;env.getCheckpointConfig().setMinPauseBetweenCheckpoints(30000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 配置 RocksDB State Backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">StreamExecutionEnvironment env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamExecutionEnvironment.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getExecutionEnvironment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStateBackend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EmbeddedRocksDBStateBackend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enableCheckpointing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每 60 秒 Checkpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCheckpointConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setCheckpointingMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CheckpointingMode.EXACTLY_ONCE);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCheckpointConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setMinPauseBetweenCheckpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"exactly-once-语义实现\">Exactly-Once 语义实现</h3><p>端到端 Exactly-Once 需要三个层面的协同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Source (Exactly-Once Read):&#10;  → Kafka Consumer: 提交 offset 与 Checkpoint 绑定&#10;  → 故障恢复时从 Checkpoint 记录的 offset 重放&#10;&#10;Processing (Exactly-Once State):&#10;  → Checkpoint: 状态快照与 Barrier 对齐&#10;  → 恢复时从最近的 Checkpoint 恢复状态&#10;&#10;Sink (Exactly-Once Write):&#10;  → 两阶段提交: Pre-commit → Checkpoint → Commit&#10;  → 幂等写入: 相同消息写入多次结果不变\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=